  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/08/IMG_7249.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>139 fotos de la segunda y &uacute;ltima jornada de la cuarta edici&oacute;n del &#39;Onda Summer Contest&#39;, que <a href=\"http://www.eltriangulo.es/contenidos/?p=48823\" target=\"_blank\">se a&ntilde;aden a las 87 publicadas del primer d&iacute;a, el viernes&nbsp;15 de agosto</a>, de este evento organizado por el Club Ondawheelz en el Skatepark municipal y que ya ha alcanzado prestigio internacional.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontest14dissabte/img_7100.jpg\" alt=\"img_7100\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontest14dissabte/img_7101.jpg\" alt=\"img_7101\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontest14dissabte/img_7102.jpg\" alt=\"img_7102\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontest14dissabte/img_7103.jpg\" alt=\"img_7103\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontest14dissabte/img_7104.jpg\" alt=\"img_7104\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontest14dissabte/img_7105.jpg\" alt=\"img_7105\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontest14dissabte/img_7106.jpg\" alt=\"img_7106\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondasummercontest14dissabte/img_7107.jpg\" alt=\"img_7107\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d